    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="27[a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 27[a]</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="27[a]" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeuw stele ⁊ hi man alese: LXX scll', swa hweder swa cyning wille;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="22" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeuw stele ⁊ hi[ne] man alese: LXX scƚƚ, swa hweder swa cyning wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave steals and a person redeems him: 70 shillings, whichever the king wants.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave steals, and is released, 70 shillings [shall be paid]—whichever the king wishes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn ein Sklav stiehlt und man ihn auslöst, [koste dies] 70 Schll., je wie der König entscheidet;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If a slave steals and he is redeemed, [this costs] 70 shillings, as the king decides;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
